message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Cubic Time Dilation Model for Enhanced GNSS"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-17
abstract: >-
  "Cubic Time Dilation Model for Enhanced GNSS Accuracy and Security" (proposal,
  September 2024), together with Module VI ("Cubic time dilation") extracted
  standalone from the Chronowave Dynamics Temporal Engine compendium -- the
  module that embodies the proposal's (1-beta^2)^(-1/3) exponent and its
  1,000-simulation validation against the operational GNSS constellation.
